BlackCrate
===========

Category-wise installation checker for offensive security tools.


OVERVIEW
--------
  BlackCrate scans your system category-wise and reports what's installed
  and what's missing across your entire offensive security toolkit.
  Designed for pentesters and red teamers who want a quick situational
  awareness check before jumping into an engagement.

  Note: BlackCrate is a checker, not an installer. Installation is intentionally
  left to the user — automated installs can break customised environments,
  conflict with existing dependencies, or bypass tools that require manual setup.
  BlackCrate tells you what's missing; you decide what to install and how.


USAGE
-----
  # download
  wget https://raw.githubusercontent.com/3rr0r-505/BlackCrate/refs/heads/main/blackcrate.sh

  # run
  chmod +x blackcrate.sh
  ./blackcrate.sh

FLAGS
-----
  --list-all                 Show all tools (installed + missing)
  --installed                Show only installed tools
  --missing                  Show only missing tools
  --category <alias>         Check a specific category by alias
  --tools                    Show category-wise tools list
  --help, -h                 Display this help message

  Examples:
    ./blackcrate.sh --list-all
    ./blackcrate.sh --installed
    ./blackcrate.sh --missing
    ./blackcrate.sh --category web
    ./blackcrate.sh --category ad


CATEGORY ALIASES
----------------
  recon-passive              Reconnaissance - Passive
  recon-active               Reconnaissance - Active
  web                        Web Application
  passwords                  Password & Hash Attacks
  exploit                    Exploitation
  ad                         Active Directory & Windows
  linux-privesc              Linux Privilege Escalation
  windows-privesc            Windows Privilege Escalation
  network                    Network & Traffic
  c2                         Post Exploitation & C2
  pivot                      Pivoting & Tunneling
  wireless                   Wireless
  re                         Reverse Engineering
  forensics                  Forensics & Steganography
  crypto                     Encoding & Crypto
  wordlists                  Wordlists & Payloads
  utils                      Utility & Workflow


OUTPUT
------
  ==================== Web Application ====================
    [✔] ffuf: installed
    [✔] sqlmap: installed
    [✘] dalfox: not installed

  ==================== Wordlists & Payloads ====================
    [✔] wordlists/: dir exists
    [✔] rockyou.txt: file exists
    [✘] seclists/: not found


